    "title": {
      "en": "New Build for WoW: Forever Beta Coming - Couple Hours Downtime",
      "es": "Nueva compilación para WoW: Forever Beta Coming - Tiempo de inactividad de un par de horas"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "New Build for WoW: Forever Beta Coming - Couple Hours Downtime...",
      "es": "Nueva compilación para WoW: Se acerca la beta de Forever - Tiempo de inactividad de un par de horas..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ab5aa8844ebb8.74669761\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">The WoW: Forever Beta is down for a couple of hours, as a new build is on the way!<br><br><a href=\"https://x.com/Zorbrix\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">Kyle Heartline</a>, Lead Game Producer on World of Warcraft, has confirmed that the WoW: Forever servers are down for a new build! He mentions that the servers will likely be down for a few hours and recommends not trying to spam login. <br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div class=\"markup-bluetweet exclude-units\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/wowheadtweets/status/2103205305379418125\">Tweet #2103205305379418125</a></div></div><br><br>According to <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/controller-and-mac-updates-wow-forever-beta-client-updated-383058\" data-contiguous=\"true\">this blue post</a>, this build is a \"full weekly update\", so we'll have to wait and see what the changes are!<div class=\"quote-box exclude-units last\" data-type=\"blizzard\" data-has-links=\"true\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\">Blizzard</div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a href=\"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2360489/1\" target=\"_blank\">View Original</a><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">We took the Beta down for maintenance and to deploy a new build. We don’t have an ETA just yet, but it should take at least a couple of hours.<br><br>We’ll have a full change log (development notes) as well as updated known issues post here soon.</div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>The WoW: Forever Beta is down for a couple of hours, as a new build is on the way!<br /><br /><a href=\"https://x.com/Zorbrix\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kyle Heartline</a>, Lead Game Producer on World of Warcraft, has confirmed that the WoW: Forever servers are down for a new build! He mentions that the servers will likely be down for a few hours and recommends not trying to spam login. <br /><br />According to <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/controller-and-mac-updates-wow-forever-beta-client-updated-383058\">this blue post</a>, this build is a &quot;full weekly update&quot;, so we'll have to wait and see what the changes are!<br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\" data-type=\"blizzard\"><div class=\"quote-header\"></div><div class=\"quote-body\">We took the Beta down for maintenance and to deploy a new build. We don’t have an ETA just yet, but it should take at least a couple of hours.<br /><br />We’ll have a full change log (development notes) as well as updated known issues post here soon.</div></div></noscript>            \n        ",
