    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ab5aa0687d7e3.02532151\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">The Forever Beta has been a raging success so far, and players have been diving into Azeroth in unprecedented numbers. That doesn't mean the launch was smooth at first, though - and there have been plenty of discoveries (both in and out of game) since then!<br><br>The first episode of the weekly World of Warcraft: Forever podcast is now out, and this week's episode dives into the launch of the Forever Beta.<div class=\"quote-box exclude-units last\" data-type=\"blizzard\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\">Blizzard</div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">\n<p>Join Senior Game Designer Josh “Aggrend” Greenfield, Lead Classic Designer Tim Jones, and content creators Countdown To Classic and Xaryu in the first episode of the <em>World of Warcraft: Forever</em> Podcast.</p>\n\n<aside class=\"video-container center-block\">\n<div class=\"video\"></div>\n</aside>\n</div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>The Forever Beta has been a raging success so far, and players have been diving into Azeroth in unprecedented numbers. That doesn't mean the launch was smooth at first, though - and there have been plenty of discoveries (both in and out of game) since then!<br /><br />The first episode of the weekly World of Warcraft: Forever podcast is now out, and this week's episode dives into the launch of the Forever Beta.<br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\" data-type=\"blizzard\"><div class=\"quote-header\"></div><div class=\"quote-body\"><br />\n<p>Join Senior Game Designer Josh “Aggrend” Greenfield, Lead Classic Designer Tim Jones, and content creators Countdown To Classic and Xaryu in the first episode of the <em>World of Warcraft: Forever</em> Podcast.</p>\n\n<aside class=\"video-container center-block\">\n<div class=\"video\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"true\" frameborder=\"0\" height=\"315\" scrolling=\"no\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/m49-jvGPCkA?si=OOd8FLHhOHWQhhwa\" width=\"560\"></iframe></div>\n</aside>\n<br /></div></div></noscript>            \n        ",
